msgstr "Usanidi wa Paywall"

#: admin/partials/paywall-settings.php:27
msgid "Configure how your paywall works, including payment amounts, content restriction, and user experience."
msgstr "Sanidi jinsi paywall yako inavyofanya kazi, ikijumuisha kiasi cha malipo, kuzuia maudhui, na uzoefu wa mtumiaji."

